majoris-files (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Complete per-file cloud capabilities, remote chooser/archive workflows,
    hidden Samba shares, guarded replacement recovery and saved rotation.
  * Add bounded RAW/HEIF/HDR decoding, isolated media playback, indexed coverage,
    grouped Grid headers and reliable external column/Nearby adapters.
  * Expand crash, decoder, real service, portal and release verification.
  * Unsigned development package; Majoris VM production acceptance remains open.

